        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "                                  \n                                               \n                                                                                                                                        \n![{\"height\":720,\"type\":\"image\",\"width\":1280}](https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240106_1498942204147111_7427015031901260391_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TZrcKTWKq10Q7kNvgFKotKL&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AYBi3NrfZX5QIc9IocnyhSTyGHReDbxShpFG4vvVktu7LA&oe=675C1E2E)\n\n**Batman: Arkham Shadow is included with the purchase of Meta Quest 3 and Meta Quest 3S.**\n\n# Become The Knight in this groundbreaking entry into the famed Arkham series.\n\n\n \nIt’s the Fourth of July, and Gotham City is under attack by a new threat: the mysterious Rat King and his cultish devotees. As widespread rioting engulfs the city, Batman races to prevent this so-called “Day of Wrath” before it all goes wrong.\n \n**Experience the World of Batman Like Never Before**\n\nImmerse yourself in all the grit of Gotham City with the power of VR, and take down its most notorious criminals.\n\n{558705893310462}\n\n**Hard-Hitting Arkham Combat**\n\nMade exclusively for VR—choose from fan favorite gadgets and bold fighting styles.\n\n{903574897963737}\n\n**Friends, Foes and Other Familiar Faces**\n\nMeet Dr. Quinzel and Dr. Crane before they became Harley Quinn and The Scarecrow, as well as other iconic characters including Harvey Dent, Ratcatcher, and Jim Gordon.\n\n{1281007706224317}",
